{"4237700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wings of Aviora", "steam_appid": 4237700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planet Aviora is being taken over by mechanical monsters rising from the ocean. The New Vravice archipelago is under siege. City council has gathered the best engineers to create the most versatile aircraft that could face these machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Aircraft Research and Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/5b08dac6bbd71d52acd5b87fc26ab61b.poster.avif?t=1784017504\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/5b08dac6bbd71d52acd5b87fc26ab61b.webm?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/5b08dac6bbd71d52acd5b87fc26ab61b.mp4?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aviora's finest team of mechanics is at your disposal. You will develop new experimental aircraft. Gather valuable insight and improve your creations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take Flight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/7fc636954071401f18fed61bfc1b8461.poster.avif?t=1784017504\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/7fc636954071401f18fed61bfc1b8461.webm?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/7fc636954071401f18fed61bfc1b8461.mp4?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No briefings, no maps to guide you. Take off from the aerodome, explore the sector, and scan the horizon for potential targets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges</strong> -&gt; Test your aircraft in target practice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberation</strong> -&gt; Mecha-Eaters are occupying key territories. Fly over there and send them back to the depths!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade Routes</strong> -&gt; Cargo ships are traversing the area. Escort them through high-risk zones and protect them from danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leviathan</strong> -&gt; Keep your eyes peeled! Giant machines lurk in the ocean depths - you don't want to mess with them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/6b96291ffe4e4137f81f29323cfd0c7e.poster.avif?t=1784017504\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/6b96291ffe4e4137f81f29323cfd0c7e.webm?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/6b96291ffe4e4137f81f29323cfd0c7e.mp4?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the area to find hidden blueprints.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Return to Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A test flight is only successful if the pilot returns with the aircraft. Keep a close eye on your fuel levels - running dry over the ocean means mission failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Photosensitivity Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains intense visual effects that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planet Aviora is being taken over by mechanical monsters rising from the ocean. The New Vravice archipelago is under siege. City council has gathered the best engineers to create the most versatile aircraft that could face these machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Aircraft Research and Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/5b08dac6bbd71d52acd5b87fc26ab61b.poster.avif?t=1784017504\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/5b08dac6bbd71d52acd5b87fc26ab61b.webm?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/5b08dac6bbd71d52acd5b87fc26ab61b.mp4?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aviora's finest team of mechanics is at your disposal. You will develop new experimental aircraft. Gather valuable insight and improve your creations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take Flight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/7fc636954071401f18fed61bfc1b8461.poster.avif?t=1784017504\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/7fc636954071401f18fed61bfc1b8461.webm?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/7fc636954071401f18fed61bfc1b8461.mp4?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No briefings, no maps to guide you. Take off from the aerodome, explore the sector, and scan the horizon for potential targets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges</strong> -&gt; Test your aircraft in target practice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberation</strong> -&gt; Mecha-Eaters are occupying key territories. Fly over there and send them back to the depths!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade Routes</strong> -&gt; Cargo ships are traversing the area. Escort them through high-risk zones and protect them from danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leviathan</strong> -&gt; Keep your eyes peeled! Giant machines lurk in the ocean depths - you don't want to mess with them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/6b96291ffe4e4137f81f29323cfd0c7e.poster.avif?t=1784017504\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/6b96291ffe4e4137f81f29323cfd0c7e.webm?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/extras/6b96291ffe4e4137f81f29323cfd0c7e.mp4?t=1784017504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the area to find hidden blueprints.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Return to Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A test flight is only successful if the pilot returns with the aircraft. Keep a close eye on your fuel levels - running dry over the ocean means mission failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Photosensitivity Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains intense visual effects that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>", "short_description": "Become an aviator on the planet Aviora. Build unique aircraft. Fight mechanical beasts in various missions located in open world. Collect blueprints and improve your aircraft.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/ea3658cb7186e46a0a68e29a1ad89c20447e33c3/header.jpg?t=1784017504", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/da701e494857be63841c32f6febe48e133d19f03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784017504", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4237700/da701e494857be63841c32f6febe48e133d19f03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784017504", "website": "https://wingsofaviora.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-7700HQ CPU @ 2.80GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li>